diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 90eac7a..3c8c3e9 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Plain numbers are no longer grouped with thousands separators: counts print as `1204` and `--currency none` amounts as `12500.00`. Money keeps its separators (`$12,500.00`). `format_number` groups digits only when given `thousands`.
 - Fixed: a thousands separator anywhere in an amount was silently dropped, so a typo like `12,34` was read as 1234. Separators are now accepted only between three-digit groups; anything else stops with `misplaced thousands separator: '12,34'`.
 - `read_csv` streams: it returns an iterator that reads one row at a time instead of a list of the whole file, and reports run in a single pass, so large files no longer need to fit in memory. A malformed line is now reported when it is reached, after the rows before it.
 - `--format csv` (and `"csv"` in `render_report` and `render_table`) writes the report for spreadsheets: header, group rows and TOTAL, amounts as bare numbers, no footer.
